WEBVTT

00:00:19.350 --> 00:00:21.770
The world is in the Gourmet Age.

00:00:22.530 --> 00:00:25.370
Gourmet Hunters are explorers 
who travel the world,

00:00:25.370 --> 00:00:28.940
searching for your ingredients.

00:00:30.110 --> 00:00:32.810
And the ingredient at 
the top of this world

00:00:33.210 --> 00:00:35.350
is GOD, which is being sought

00:00:35.350 --> 00:00:38.110
by one Gourmet Hunter.

00:00:44.340 --> 00:00:47.190
Go! Shock!! Gourmet!! Gourmet!!

00:00:51.020 --> 00:00:53.700
Go! Shock!!

00:00:55.460 --> 00:00:58.270
Friends who can eat the same dream

00:00:58.270 --> 00:01:01.070
Friends who share the same future

00:01:01.360 --> 00:01:03.820
With you guys

00:01:03.820 --> 00:01:06.790
It’s first-rate gourmet my way!

00:01:06.800 --> 00:01:09.770
If we join forces

00:01:09.770 --> 00:01:12.530
We’ll be invincible

00:01:12.530 --> 00:01:15.850
Come on, let’s show ‘em

00:01:17.900 --> 00:01:23.460
Delicious food gives life

00:01:23.870 --> 00:01:29.100
So be thankful for everything and

00:01:29.100 --> 00:01:31.070
Let’s eat!!

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:34.070
We can’t lose!! We can’t be stopped!!

00:01:34.070 --> 00:01:37.080
We ain’t gonna let ‘em have that

00:01:37.980 --> 00:01:42.450
We’re gonna win it!! Shock! Shock! Gourmet king!!

00:01:42.450 --> 00:01:45.320
Spiked Punch!! Infinity!!

00:01:45.320 --> 00:01:49.050
I’ll punch through with this fist

00:01:49.290 --> 00:01:52.960
First-rate gourmet my way!

00:01:53.160 --> 00:01:56.130
Let’s gather ‘round the table

00:01:56.130 --> 00:02:00.030
For the sake of tomorrow

00:02:00.220 --> 00:02:02.280
Let’s go! Go! Gourmet!!

00:02:08.310 --> 00:02:12.180
Toriko confronted Starjun, who 
attacked the Cooking Fest.

00:02:13.330 --> 00:02:16.480
Chefs, Gourmet Knights, 
and the Gourmet Mafia

00:02:16.480 --> 00:02:18.540
fought back against waves

00:02:18.540 --> 00:02:21.190
of the attacking Gourmet Corp. army.

00:02:24.610 --> 00:02:28.730
But then an even greater crisis closed 
in on the battlefield that was the Fest.

00:02:33.720 --> 00:02:35.130
Toriko...

00:02:35.640 --> 00:02:38.680
Don't tell me this is all you've got...

00:02:39.430 --> 00:02:40.710
Course not!

00:02:41.130 --> 00:02:44.710
At this level, you'll never beat me.

00:02:45.540 --> 00:02:47.780
Oh, I'm gonna treat you,

00:02:48.060 --> 00:02:50.060
so get ready to eat

00:02:50.060 --> 00:02:51.980
my full course of attacks!

00:02:56.590 --> 00:03:01.440
Worst Trump Card! The Gourmet 
World Monster, "Nitro"!

00:03:07.240 --> 00:03:09.330
Full course of attacks, eh?

00:03:09.840 --> 00:03:11.840
Splitting my Shiba Helmet

00:03:12.120 --> 00:03:14.040
is what you would call 
the appetizer then?

00:03:15.760 --> 00:03:19.240
In that case, I'll do you a favor and 
linger over every dish of your meal.

00:03:20.770 --> 00:03:23.190
Will I be able to stick 
it out to the main dish?

00:03:25.660 --> 00:03:27.090
Why, you...

00:03:27.990 --> 00:03:31.330
Flying Fork!

00:03:39.110 --> 00:03:41.470
And now get a taste of this!

00:03:54.590 --> 00:03:59.910
Twin Cannon Fork!

00:04:39.950 --> 00:04:40.890
Toriko...

00:04:42.170 --> 00:04:43.730
This reminds me...

00:04:48.240 --> 00:04:49.520
You're slow.

00:04:50.970 --> 00:04:54.170
It took you .5 seconds 
to prepare for battle.

00:04:54.710 --> 00:04:56.510
I could have killed you 
easily ten times over.

00:05:02.010 --> 00:05:03.150
Finally...

00:05:03.890 --> 00:05:06.650
This is what makes it worth beating you.

00:05:12.800 --> 00:05:15.180
Eat or be eaten...

00:05:15.180 --> 00:05:18.010
A serious fight with our 
lives on the line...

00:05:18.640 --> 00:05:20.530
And if I give him another opening,

00:05:20.960 --> 00:05:23.770
I'm sure it'll be the end of my life!

00:05:49.060 --> 00:05:50.610
What the...?!

00:05:50.610 --> 00:05:53.570
You're only half-baked under those bandages?

00:05:53.920 --> 00:05:55.710
Is that all I did?

00:05:56.120 --> 00:05:57.960
Impressive.

00:05:57.960 --> 00:06:01.970
But then you did win the 
Cooking Fest once before.

00:06:02.480 --> 00:06:03.600
That power

00:06:04.170 --> 00:06:07.550
will be put to good use by Gourmet Corp.

00:06:07.850 --> 00:06:11.830
I ain't goin' to any Gourmet Corp.!

00:06:18.180 --> 00:06:20.310
Don't let a guy catch his breath, do ya?

00:06:23.130 --> 00:06:26.140
Pain in the ass!

00:06:51.370 --> 00:06:54.990
They're scorched to the bone marrow.

00:07:02.520 --> 00:07:05.550
Why only him...?

00:07:05.900 --> 00:07:08.870
How can he get fried 
and still be alive?!

00:07:18.640 --> 00:07:20.080
Run!

00:07:20.430 --> 00:07:22.490
Hurry up! This way!

00:07:24.020 --> 00:07:27.690
Shoot... I got separated from 
President Moy and the others.

00:07:28.250 --> 00:07:31.830
A-Anyway, what an uproar 
this has turned into.

00:07:33.010 --> 00:07:35.110
I hope Koma-chan is safe...

00:07:41.180 --> 00:07:42.740
President Moy?

00:08:01.720 --> 00:08:06.360
Currently, Gourmet Corp. appears 
to be at a slight disadvantage.

00:08:08.170 --> 00:08:10.700
Perhaps it's about time to intervene?

00:08:12.440 --> 00:08:15.840
No. Let's wait and see a bit more.

00:08:16.690 --> 00:08:20.320
But IGO and Gourmet Corp...

00:08:20.320 --> 00:08:24.420
If both sides don't 
obliterate each other,

00:08:24.880 --> 00:08:28.500
our plans won't turn 
out exactly as we wish.

00:08:29.650 --> 00:08:33.440
Gourmet Corp. has a trump card.

00:08:34.610 --> 00:08:37.680
And they should be 
arriving any minute now.

00:09:02.130 --> 00:09:06.490
You things just don't 
learn your lesson, do you?

00:09:16.550 --> 00:09:18.120
Chef Komatsu...

00:09:18.120 --> 00:09:20.740
Your eyes are closed, aren't they?

00:09:20.740 --> 00:09:22.610
Y-Yes!

00:09:22.990 --> 00:09:26.410
Whatever you do, keep them shut.

00:09:38.130 --> 00:09:39.810
Confetti Salt.

00:09:40.270 --> 00:09:42.660
It stings the eyes something fierce.

00:10:00.070 --> 00:10:02.780
Give up, already!

00:10:13.120 --> 00:10:14.830
Chef Makube!

00:10:15.900 --> 00:10:19.200
I let my guard down a little.

00:11:28.400 --> 00:11:29.630
Is that...

00:11:56.500 --> 00:11:59.310
Hey, you weren't supposed to do that.

00:11:58.780 --> 00:12:05.340
Zaragira
Head of Food Management, Gourmet Corp.

00:12:00.160 --> 00:12:02.800
You don't kill the chefs!

00:12:03.150 --> 00:12:05.340
You capture them alive!

00:12:05.890 --> 00:12:07.880
Alright, Scum Beast,

00:12:07.880 --> 00:12:10.840
throw every single 
chef here into a cage!

00:12:14.770 --> 00:12:15.880
Makube!

00:12:16.060 --> 00:12:17.430
Chef Yuda!

00:12:17.430 --> 00:12:20.630
Chef Komatsu, get away from here now!

00:12:23.050 --> 00:12:23.890
But...

00:12:24.160 --> 00:12:26.720
Treasure the way Makube and the others

00:12:26.720 --> 00:12:28.160
protected you!

00:12:32.770 --> 00:12:34.630
Now go!

00:12:36.500 --> 00:12:37.460
Okay!

00:12:50.700 --> 00:12:52.940
Emperor of Chinese Cuisine...

00:12:53.740 --> 00:12:56.390
Sorry, but I'm going to put 
you to sleep for a while.

00:12:59.370 --> 00:13:00.360
Cage Monster!

00:13:11.730 --> 00:13:14.500
That's right! Keep locking 'em up!

00:13:14.500 --> 00:13:16.460
But remember, we want 'em alive!

00:13:16.460 --> 00:13:17.980
If they give you any 
trouble, put 'em to sleep!

00:13:23.830 --> 00:13:26.540
Okay, tear this place apart...

00:13:26.540 --> 00:13:27.990
...Nitro!

00:14:20.820 --> 00:14:23.170
Twin Leg Boomerang...

00:14:25.240 --> 00:14:27.440
If I can build up power for a while,

00:14:27.440 --> 00:14:30.750
I think I can attack him 
in rapid-fire mode...

00:14:43.620 --> 00:14:46.440
It seems your leg attacks are 
shelved for the time being.

00:14:47.300 --> 00:14:49.360
If you want some more,

00:14:49.360 --> 00:14:51.540
I'll keep dishin' it out!

00:14:52.510 --> 00:14:55.580
But first, try this!

00:15:02.490 --> 00:15:06.620
Sword of Perfection! One 
millimeter-thin strips!

00:15:32.630 --> 00:15:33.690
Yuda!

00:16:01.550 --> 00:16:03.030
Magic Spice!

00:16:14.470 --> 00:16:15.760
Here's my chance!

00:16:16.420 --> 00:16:17.960
Brain Cut!

00:16:24.710 --> 00:16:25.580
Huh?

00:16:41.930 --> 00:16:43.050
Livebearer!

00:16:43.940 --> 00:16:45.510
Close your eyes!

00:16:46.320 --> 00:16:47.890
Sunshine Firefly!

00:16:56.540 --> 00:16:58.300
Sunshine Firefly...

00:16:58.900 --> 00:17:02.140
An insect that releases a flash 
of light as strong as the sun,

00:17:02.140 --> 00:17:04.900
making it useful for 
blinding an opponent.

00:17:07.190 --> 00:17:08.070
Body Glue!

00:17:10.470 --> 00:17:12.040
Doctor Aloe!

00:17:18.250 --> 00:17:19.970
Incredible.

00:17:19.970 --> 00:17:21.340
In just a moment,

00:17:21.850 --> 00:17:24.260
he blocked the sensation of pain.

00:17:24.900 --> 00:17:26.970
A Reviver, yes?

00:17:27.430 --> 00:17:29.160
I owe you one.

00:17:29.590 --> 00:17:32.860
But you're out of this 
fight, Livebearer.

00:17:33.710 --> 00:17:35.630
Anyway, that thing...

00:17:36.730 --> 00:17:39.000
I know about its existence

00:17:39.800 --> 00:17:43.640
from data that I stole long ago.

00:17:44.140 --> 00:17:44.880
It can't be...

00:17:45.600 --> 00:17:47.260
Nitro.

00:17:48.480 --> 00:17:52.370
Monsters that live in the Gourmet World.

00:17:52.720 --> 00:17:54.300
Damned Gourmet Corp...

00:17:55.090 --> 00:17:58.270
They brought another 
terrifying creature to us!

00:17:58.680 --> 00:18:00.080
Even so,

00:18:00.730 --> 00:18:03.690
I wonder how they got

00:18:03.690 --> 00:18:07.540
the ferocious Nitro to obey them...

00:18:08.050 --> 00:18:09.530
It's simple.

00:18:10.620 --> 00:18:15.110
The boss of Gourmet Corp. is even 
more of a monster than they are.

00:18:16.970 --> 00:18:17.940
Besides,

00:18:18.470 --> 00:18:19.890
it's more than just the Nitro.

00:18:28.110 --> 00:18:31.590
Powerful Scum Beasts that can even 
use Honoring the Food are also here.

00:18:32.560 --> 00:18:34.960
They can't be dealt with 
by any ordinary means.

00:18:35.880 --> 00:18:37.010
The real battle...

00:18:40.550 --> 00:18:41.990
...is about to begin!

00:18:44.490 --> 00:18:45.940
And here they come!

00:19:07.820 --> 00:19:10.400
Coco of the Four Kings!

00:19:10.940 --> 00:19:17.510
Your poison doesn't affect 
me in the slightest!

00:19:21.380 --> 00:19:24.410
In that case, I'll let you 
drink as much as you like!

00:19:27.060 --> 00:19:28.810
Poison Dressing!

00:19:37.280 --> 00:19:37.760
Wha...?!

00:19:39.790 --> 00:19:43.760
I can't get enough of that flavor!

00:19:44.430 --> 00:19:47.600
Hey, let me have some more!

00:19:47.950 --> 00:19:52.140
That stimulating stuff hits the spot!

00:21:02.620 --> 00:21:07.590
Guess the Legend
The Legend Gourmet Quiz

00:21:03.390 --> 00:21:05.340
Guess the Legend!

00:21:05.340 --> 00:21:07.580
The Legend Gourmet Quiz!

00:21:07.880 --> 00:21:09.490
I'm your host, Tina.

00:21:09.490 --> 00:21:13.530
Alright, this is a heaping helping 
of an epoch-making segment,

00:21:13.530 --> 00:21:16.620
in which you guess the legendary 
ingredients of the Gourmet Age!

00:21:20.170 --> 00:21:26.270
Really?! Level 4

00:21:20.800 --> 00:21:23.700
Today's "Really?!" level is 4.

00:21:24.310 --> 00:21:26.270
Someone once said...

00:21:26.710 --> 00:21:29.820
Heavenly voice! Please 
help me today too!

00:21:29.820 --> 00:21:32.600
Sure, sure. Okay, here I go.

00:21:33.050 --> 00:21:35.800
Really?! Level 4

00:21:33.300 --> 00:21:35.850
Someone once said...

00:21:36.290 --> 00:21:41.840
There are chestnut trees upon 
which soft, doughy, sweet,

00:21:41.840 --> 00:21:45.110
bean jam-filled rice cakes 
grow inside spiny burrs...

00:21:45.110 --> 00:21:47.880
Something-something-something-something!

00:21:48.250 --> 00:21:50.690
The allotted time limit is 10 seconds.

00:21:50.690 --> 00:21:51.860
Start!

00:21:52.790 --> 00:21:55.740
I don't think you need a 
hint for this one, do you?

00:21:56.500 --> 00:21:57.940
W-Wait a second! Um...

00:21:58.340 --> 00:22:01.920
Bean jam rice cake and chestnut, so...

00:22:03.230 --> 00:22:05.520
Someone once said...

00:22:05.080 --> 00:22:18.140
Bean Jam Rice Chestcake

00:22:05.520 --> 00:22:07.530
There are chestnut trees

00:22:07.530 --> 00:22:10.880
upon which soft, doughy, sweet,

00:22:10.880 --> 00:22:14.020
bean jam-filled rice cakes 
grow inside spiny burrs...

00:22:14.020 --> 00:22:18.360
Bean Jam Rice Chestcakes!

00:22:20.930 --> 00:22:22.410
Nice!

00:22:22.410 --> 00:22:27.530
I'd love to eat a yummy bean jam rice 
cake under a Chestcake tree every day!

00:22:27.530 --> 00:22:32.250
When you go chestnut gathering, be 
sure to pick ripe, brown chestnuts.

00:22:32.250 --> 00:22:37.340
Blue ones are just sticky rice or bean 
paste before they become rice cakes.

00:22:39.400 --> 00:22:40.840
And now...

00:22:41.110 --> 00:22:44.280
And now, let's get back on 
track with our next segment!
